    "sections": {
        "description": "Interior Services is a flexible theme created for interior designers, decorators, architects, and creative studios. It offers structured layouts for presenting portfolios, project details, service listings, and client testimonials in a clear and organized manner. The theme includes ready-made sections for showcasing residential and commercial projects, renovation work, and design concepts. Gallery and project display options allow users to present images with descriptions to highlight completed work. Its responsive design ensures compatibility across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Built-in customization settings make it easy to adjust colors, typography, and layout styles without editing code. Interior Services follows standard coding practices and supports commonly used plugins for contact forms and extended functionality, providing a reliable foundation for building a professional design-focused website."
    },
